### Global CSS

To customize the Meter component classes, you can use the `@layer components` directive.
[Learn more](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/adding-custom-styles#adding-component-classes).

```css
@layer components {
  .meter {
    @apply w-full gap-2;
  }

  .meter__track {
    @apply h-3 rounded-full;
  }

  .meter__fill {
    @apply rounded-full;
  }
}
```

